# The witness that stops regrowth (last): extend tools/evergreen-boundary.mjs with (i) a tracked-test census of retired-name assertions (`not.toContain("<retired>")`, retired-command arrays, old env/URL fixtures), (ii) a structural rule refusing `onupgradeneeded` bodies that delete stores or rows by retired keys, and (iii) the live canon corpus (`bags/**/api`, `mesh`, `browser` .mem, excluding record carriers) for history-narrating words. Measure each new class's count BEFORE setting its ceiling. A red with a known positive and a control comes for each class (silent-zero law).

<<~/ahu>>

